@startuml uc-apply-saved-plan
!include _theme.iuml

state applySavedPlan as "applySavedPlan()" {

  state " " as PresentingArtifact
  state " " as Verifying
  state " " as Executing

  [*] --> PresentingArtifact
  note on link
  <b>Change reviewer</b> hands over a saved plan and asks for
  exactly the operations it records
  end note

  PresentingArtifact --> Verifying
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> re-checks six things before touching anything
  • the artifact schema version
  • the expiry
  • the authenticated actor
  • each account's numeric identity
  • the digest of every configuration source file
  • the digest of the resolved configuration
  end note

  Verifying --> Executing
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> performs exactly the recorded operations; it
  does not re-plan and does not re-observe
  end note

  Executing --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Change reviewer</b> receives an outcome for the plan they
  approved, not for a plan produced in their absence
  end note
}

applySavedPlan --> CHANGES_APPLIED
note on link
every check held; exit 0
end note

applySavedPlan -[#A78BFA]-> CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED
note on link
one check moved: the run refuses, names which
one, and exits 2 · a stale plan is never
silently repaired or re-planned
end note
@enduml
